  {
    "id": "8d8b59ba-fc70-41a4-acf1-06a95945b611",
    "previewToken": "9bad1c9c-94fc-464c-96d3-13b4a54cd11b",
    "title": "Reading Contribution Margin Like an Operator",
    "slug": "contribution-margin-for-operators",
    "excerpt": "Revenue is vanity. Contribution margin per ASIN is the number that tells you if growth is actually worth having.",
    "content": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Revenue is a vanity metric until you subtract ads, fees, and cost of goods. Contribution margin is what's left — and it's the only number that tells you whether growth is actually worth having."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Formula"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Contribution margin = Net Revenue − COGS − Fulfillment Fees − Advertising Spend − Returns."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "attrs": {
            "variant": "info"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Track it per-ASIN, not just at the account level — the account-level number hides which SKUs are quietly subsidizing the rest."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Reading It Like an Operator"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "orderedList",
          "attrs": {
            "start": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Rank SKUs by contribution margin dollars, not percentage"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Flag anything trending down for two consecutive weeks"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Re-check ad spend allocation against the ranked list monthly"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "A profitable SKU losing share is usually a pricing problem. A growing SKU losing margin is usually an ad-spend problem."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
